    <header class="ehead has-media">
      <div class="crumbbar"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/mcp-servers/">MCP servers</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/mcp-servers/research/">Research</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">AIMarket MCP server</span></nav><div class="dtools"><button type="button" class="btn btn-line btn-sm fav" data-fav="mcp" data-ref="alexar76-aimarket-mcp" aria-pressed="false"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20s-7-4.4-9-9.1C1.7 7.6 3.9 4.5 7.2 4.5c2 0 3.6 1.1 4.8 2.8 1.2-1.7 2.8-2.8 4.8-2.8 3.3 0 5.5 3.1 4.2 6.4C19 15.6 12 20 12 20z"/></svg> <span>Favorite</span></button><a class="btn btn-line btn-sm" href="https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcompleteaitraining.com%2Fmcp-servers%2Falexar76-aimarket-mcp%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Share on LinkedIn"><svg class="ic" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M20.45 20.45h-3.56v-5.57c0-1.33-.02-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.85 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.35V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.48-.9 1.64-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.13 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.13zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .77 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.23.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.77 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .77 23.2 0 22.22 0z"/></svg><span class="lbl">Share</span></a><button type="button" class="btn btn-line btn-sm" data-copy="https://completeaitraining.com/mcp-servers/alexar76-aimarket-mcp/" aria-label="Copy link" title="Copy link"><svg class="ic" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M5 15V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9"/></svg></button></div></div>
      <div class="ehead-in">
      <div class="ehead-txt">
        <p class="eyebrow">MCP server · Research · official</p>
        <h1 class="h-l etitle">AIMarket MCP server</h1>
        <p class="mcp-by">by <a href="https://github.com/alexar76" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">alexar76</a> · official</p>
        <p class="lede">Lets your AI fetch web pages, run web searches, verify answers, and look up paid capabilities on the AIMarket hub.</p>
        <div class="eactions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#install"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg> Install it with your AI</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-mcp" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">View on GitHub <svg class="ic" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 5h5v5M19 5l-8 8M18 14v5H5V6h5"/></svg></a></div>
        <div class="chips"><a class="chip" href="/mcp-servers/research/">Research</a><a class="chip" href="/mcp-servers/?tag=security">Security</a></div>
      </div>
      <figure class="ehead-media"><img class="mcp-thumb" src="https://cdn.completeaitraining.com/mcp/flow/alexar76-aimarket-mcp/aimarket-mcp-server-flow-diagram.webp?v=pocik8" alt="Flow diagram: you ask your AI “Search the web and check this claim for me”, the AIMarket MCP server reaches Web pages, Web search, Metis checker and Paid tools, and you get back answer in your chat." title="How the AIMarket MCP server works" width="960" height="540" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high"></figure></div>
    </header>
    <div class="egrid">
      <div class="emain app-main">
        <section class="appsec" id="intro"><p>This is a small helper program that gives your AI a few extra skills: reading web pages, searching the web, double-checking answers, and browsing a marketplace of paid tools. It is made by the same team behind the Metis and ARGUS tools, and it is aimed at people who want their AI to reach outside the chat safely. You do not need to be technical to use it once someone sets it up for you.</p></section>

        <details class="mcp-what mcp-what-page" id="what-is-mcp"><summary><svg class="ic" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg> What is an MCP server? <span class="soft">The 30-second version</span></summary><p>On its own, your AI can only chat with you using what it already learned. An MCP server is a small helper program you connect to your AI, and it gives the AI a new skill or a connection to an outside service. This one connects your AI to the web and to the AIMarket hub, so it can look up pages, run searches, check answers, and find paid tools when you ask. Think of it as adding a few new buttons to your AI&#39;s toolbar.</p></details>

        <section class="appsec" id="what"><h2 class="h-m">What this MCP server does</h2><p>You ask your AI something in plain words, like to read a web page or search for a topic. The AI passes your request to this helper program. The helper then talks to the web or to the AIMarket hub, gathers what it needs, and cleans up the result before sending it back. Your AI shows you the answer in the chat, usually as text or a short summary. For the marketplace tools, it can also find paid capabilities and run one on a free trial, then hand you a receipt.</p><a class="mcp-flow mcp-flow-wide" href="https://cdn.completeaitraining.com/mcp/flow/alexar76-aimarket-mcp/how-the-aimarket-mcp-server-works.webp?v=pocik8" data-zoom="How the AIMarket MCP server works" title="How the AIMarket MCP server works (click to zoom)" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="https://cdn.completeaitraining.com/mcp/flow/alexar76-aimarket-mcp/how-the-aimarket-mcp-server-works.webp?v=pocik8" alt="Flow diagram: you ask your AI “Search the web and check this claim for me”, the AIMarket MCP server reaches Web pages, Web search, Metis checker and Paid tools, and you get back answer in your chat." title="How the AIMarket MCP server works" width="1200" height="750" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><span class="zoom-hint"><svg class="ic" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"/></svg> Click to zoom</span></a></section>

        <section class="appsec" id="can-do"><h2 class="h-m">What you can do with it</h2>
          <ul class="packlist"><li><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"/></svg><span>Fetch a web page and give you the main text</span></li><li><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"/></svg><span>Run a live web search and show the top results</span></li><li><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"/></svg><span>Ask Metis to verify an answer and return a confidence score</span></li><li><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"/></svg><span>Search the AIMarket hub for priced capabilities</span></li><li><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"/></svg><span>Run one marketplace capability on the free trial tier</span></li><li><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"/></svg><span>Get a signed receipt for each marketplace call</span></li><li><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"/></svg><span>Point the marketplace tools at your own hub if you have one</span></li></ul>
          <h3 class="h-s appsub">Try asking your AI</h3><ul class="mcp-asks"><li>“Fetch this page and summarize the main points: https://example.com/article”</li><li>“Search the web for the latest news about electric cars and give me the top results”</li><li>“Use Metis to verify this claim and tell me how confident it is”</li><li>“Find a weather reading capability on the AIMarket hub and run it for device om-wx-01”</li></ul></section>

        <section class="appsec" id="returns"><h2 class="h-m">What it gives back to you</h2><p>You get answers in the chat, usually as plain text. Web fetches come back as the main readable text of the page, and searches come back as a short list of top results. Metis verification returns an answer plus a confidence score and a yes or no on whether it passed. Marketplace calls return the result of the capability plus a signed receipt number, or a clear message when the free trial is used up.</p></section>

        <section class="appsec" id="needs"><h2 class="h-m">Before you start</h2>
          <div class="appglance">
            <div class=""><p class="eyebrow">What you need</p><ul class="mcp-needs"><li>An MCP client like Claude Desktop or Cursor</li><li>Python and the uvx tool installed (or Docker if you self-host)</li><li>Optional: an AIMarket Metis key if you want to use a private Metis endpoint</li><li>Optional: an AIMarket hub URL if you want to use your own hub instead of the default</li></ul></div>
            <div class="mcp-caution"><p class="eyebrow">Good to know</p><p>The marketplace tools can spend money if you move past the free trial, and web fetches read pages from the internet, so only point it at sites you trust.</p></div>
          </div></section>

        <section class="appsec appbuild-sec" id="install">
          <p class="eyebrow">Install it with your AI</p><h2 class="h-m">Add AIMarket MCP server to your AI, no technical skills needed</h2>
          <p class="soft">You don't install anything by hand. You copy one prompt, paste it into an AI that can work on your computer, and it checks, installs and connects the server for you, asking you when it needs something.</p>
          <div class="buildopt buildlock">
            <h3><svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 11V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"/></svg> Sign in to get the install prompt</h3>
            <p>Members get a ready-made prompt that lets the Claude desktop app check AIMarket MCP server, install it and connect it for them, step by step. You don't need any technical skills: you copy, paste and answer a few questions. Your connected AI can also find and install any of the 4,611 MCP servers here for you.</p>
            <p class="row"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="/signin/?next=%2Fmcp-servers%2Falexar76-aimarket-mcp%2F%23install">Sign in</a> <a class="btn btn-line btn-sm" href="/join/?back=%2Fmcp-servers%2Falexar76-aimarket-mcp%2F">Start for Free</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="appsec" id="who"><h2 class="h-m">Who it's for</h2><p>Office workers and researchers who want their AI to read web pages, run searches, and check answers without leaving the chat.</p>
          <h3 class="h-s mcp-roles-h">Jobs it suits</h3><div class="chips mcp-roles"><a class="chip" href="/learningpath/ai-for-content-writers/" title="AI for Content Writers">Content Writers</a><a class="chip" href="/learningpath/ai-for-competitive-intelligence-analysts/" title="AI for Competitive Intelligence Analysts">Competitive Intelligence Analysts</a><a class="chip" href="/learningpath/ai-for-journalists/" title="AI for Journalists">Journalists</a><a class="chip" href="/learningpath/ai-for-phd-students/" title="AI for PhD Students">PhD Students</a><a class="chip" href="/learningpath/ai-for-bloggers/" title="AI for Bloggers">Bloggers</a><a class="chip" href="/learningpath/ai-for-content-marketing-managers/" title="AI for Content Marketing Managers">Content Marketing Managers</a><a class="chip" href="/learningpath/ai-for-research-scientists/" title="AI for Research Scientists">Research Scientists</a><a class="chip" href="/learningpath/ai-for-professors/" title="AI for Professors">Professors</a><a class="chip" href="/learningpath/ai-for-postdoctoral-researchers/" title="AI for Postdoctoral Researchers">Postdoctoral Researchers</a><a class="chip" href="/learningpath/ai-for-research-associates/" title="AI for Research Associates">Research Associates</a><a class="chip" href="/learningpath/ai-for-product-marketing-managers/" title="AI for Product Marketing Managers">Product Marketing Managers</a><a class="chip" href="/learningpath/ai-for-social-scientists/" title="AI for Social Scientists">Social Scientists</a></div></section>
